      \        candidate = result.stdout\n        return (candidate, path.stem + '.ogg')\
      \ if 0 < len(candidate) < len(original) else (original, path.name)\n\n\nclass\
      \ _TransferCore:\n    \"\"\"Selective Repeat, independently in each direction\
      \ (one file per direction).\n\n    META (0) is acknowledged before DATA (1..N).\
      \ DATA uses a bounded sliding\n    window and individual ACKs/timers. END (N+1)\
      \ is sent after all DATA ACKs,\n    and acknowledged only after SHA-256 verification\
      \ and saving the file.\n    32-bit sequence numbers never wrap within a transfer.\
      \ A random 128-bit\n    transfer ID separates transfers. All methods run on\
